WEBVTT

1
00:00:09.334 --> 00:00:19.069
Hello! Who are you?

2
00:00:19.070 --> 00:00:22.524
I'm a manta ray.

3
00:00:22.525 --> 00:00:27.728
We're the biggest rays on earth.

4
00:00:27.729 --> 00:00:30.892
Are you a fish?

5
00:00:30.893 --> 00:00:34.547
Yes, rays are fish.

6
00:00:34.548 --> 00:00:40.361
We have flat bodies and long tails.

7
00:00:40.362 --> 00:00:43.844
Where do you live?

8
00:00:43.845 --> 00:00:48.458
Manta rays live in the ocean.

9
00:00:48.459 --> 00:00:53.874
We like to swim in warm water.

10
00:00:53.875 --> 00:00:57.063
What do you eat?

11
00:00:57.064 --> 00:01:02.316
We eat very tiny fish and plants.

12
00:01:02.317 --> 00:01:06.080
They are called plankton.

13
00:01:06.081 --> 00:01:15.742
We swim with our mouths open to catch plankton.

14
00:01:15.743 --> 00:01:19.974
Do you have any enemies?

15
00:01:19.975 --> 00:01:24.779
Sharks and whales like to eat us.

16
00:01:24.780 --> 00:01:30.865
Sometimes we get stuck in people's fishing nets.

17
00:01:30.866 --> 00:01:34.565
Do you ever sting people?

18
00:01:34.566 --> 00:01:39.061
Many rays do sting people.

19
00:01:39.062 --> 00:01:42.757
But manta rays don't have stingers.

20
00:01:42.758 --> 00:01:47.850
We are usually calm and gentle around people.

21
00:01:47.851 --> 00:01:50.562
How do you swim?

22
00:01:50.563 --> 00:01:54.557
Our fins are like huge wings.

23
00:01:54.558 --> 00:02:03.772
We flap them to move through the water.

24
00:02:03.773 --> 00:02:09.944
We can even dive and do loops.

25
00:02:09.945 --> 00:02:17.090
I see some plankton. Watch this!

26
00:02:17.091 --> 00:02:23.072
Good-bye, Manta Ray!
